{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPanelElements",
  "$description": "The Insert panel: the palette a page is built out of. Two tabs, Elements and Components, then one filter for whichever is showing, then that tab's cards: the HTML elements in an accordion of categories, or the project's components. The adapter (`surfaces/panel-elements.ts`) is handed cards that are already filtered, already named in the reader's language and already sorted into sections that know whether they are open, so nothing here asks what an element is called, which npm components the document has enabled, or what the filter means. A card is inserted by CLICK from this document and by DRAG from `panels/dnd.ts`, which registers against the painted card — that seam is why three class names survive the conversion, and the style block says why.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "palette"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What this block does NOT contain is most of the conversion. `.elements-list` and `.elements-list sp-accordion-item` are gone rather than moved: the first removed a border Spectrum's accordion drew and the kit's does not, and the second drew the hairline between two sections and set an 11px header — `jx-accordion` draws that separator itself (`& > :not([hidden]) ~ *`) and `jx-accordion-item` owns its own summary, so transcribing either would be re-deciding something the kit has already decided. `.element-card`, `.element-card-preview` and `.element-card-label` are NOT this document's to take, and that is why they are still spelled as classes here: the same card is drawn by `panels/stylebook-doc.ts` for its specimens and re-declared inside the canvas iframe by `canvas/iframe-render.ts`, and `panels/dnd.ts` addresses `.components-section` and `.element-card-preview` BY SELECTOR to hang the drag on a row and to fill its preview with a live element. A card is a shared object with three readers; moving its look in here would fork it. An element card's preview is drawn EMPTY for the same reason: `dnd.ts` fills it with the element rendered live, and it fills only a preview it finds with no children in it. What is left below is what belongs to the palette alone.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "minHeight": "0",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"filter\"]": {
      "$description": "The filter is inset from the panel's edges; `.panel-body` sets `padding: 0`, so the field sat flush against three of them. It stretches because the palette is a flex column, which is also what `sp-search` got for free from being a block.",
      "margin": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The one empty-state pattern (`panels/empty-state.ts`), drawn here because a document cannot render a lit helper. `.empty-state` and `.empty-state--teach` keep their stylesheet — every panel still lit renders through that helper — so this is a copy rather than a move, and it goes when the last of them converts. Its 13px was the one value with no token behind it; the kit's `--jx-text-md` is the scale this chrome is on.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-6)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-message\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "maxWidth": "34ch",
      "lineHeight": "1.5"
    },
    "& [part=\"component-tag\"]": {
      "$description": "What a component card shows until `panels/dnd.ts` replaces it with the component rendered live. It was an inline `style=` reading `--spectrum-font-size-50` with an 11px fallback — a name that resolves only inside `<sp-theme>`, and this document is mounted into the Navigator's panel body, where that element is not an ancestor — so the size is the kit's scale and the colour the studio layer's.",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontStyle": "italic"
    },
    "& [part=\"tabs\"]": {
      "$description": "Two words in the Navigator's column. Each tab takes half the strip rather than the kit tab's own width, so the pair reads as a switch between two halves of one palette, not as two documents.",
      "flex": "0 0 auto",
      "gap": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"tab\"]": {
      "flex": "1 1 0",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "maxWidth": "none",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-1) var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"panel\"]": {
      "$description": "The kit's tab panel pads itself for a dialog; here the filter above it already sets the inset, and the accordion runs edge to edge as it did before the tabs.",
      "padding": "0",
      "minHeight": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"components-section\"]": {
      "$description": "The component cards sit in one column with the inset an accordion item gives its body, since this tab has no accordion around them.",
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2) var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"element-name\"]": {
      "$description": "A card's caption leads with the element's name in the reader's language, in the chrome's own type. `.element-card-label` (styles/panels.css) is monospace for the tag it used to hold alone; the name is prose, so it takes the sans face back.",
      "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"element-tag\"]": {
      "$description": "The tag rides beside the name, dimmer, for the author who knows HTML and for the filter, which matches it too.",
      "marginInlineStart": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-actions\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "jx-tabs",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "tabs",
        "selected": "${state.tab}"
      },
      "$props": {
        "label": "Insert"
      },
      "onchange": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/selectTab"
            },
            "value": [
              {
                "$ref": "event#/detail"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tab",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "tab",
            "id": "insert-tab-elements",
            "data-tab": "elements",
            "value": "elements",
            "label": "Elements",
            "panel": "insert-panel-elements"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tab",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "tab",
            "id": "insert-tab-components",
            "data-tab": "components",
            "value": "components",
            "label": "Components",
            "panel": "insert-panel-components"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-textfield",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "filter"
      },
      "$props": {
        "size": "sm",
        "type": "search",
        "clearable": true,
        "label": "${state.filterLabel}",
        "placeholder": "${state.filterLabel}…",
        "value": {
          "$ref": "#/state/filter"
        }
      },
      "oninput": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/setFilter"
            },
            "value": [
              {
                "$ref": "event#/target/value"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-tab-panel",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "panel",
        "id": "insert-panel-elements",
        "data-tab": "elements"
      },
      "$props": {
        "active": {
          "$ref": "#/state/elementsShowing"
        },
        "labelledby": "insert-tab-elements"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "empty-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/elementsEmpty"
          },
          "cases": {
            "filtered": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-message"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Nothing here matches “${state.filter}”."
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-actions"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "jx-button",
                      "$props": {
                        "size": "sm"
                      },
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "clear-filter"
                      },
                      "onclick": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/clearFilter"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "textContent": "Clear the filter"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "other-tab-slot",
                        "role": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "display": "contents"
                      },
                      "$switch": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/hasOtherMatches"
                      },
                      "cases": {
                        "true": {
                          "tagName": "jx-button",
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm"
                          },
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "show-other-tab"
                          },
                          "onclick": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/showOtherTab"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "textContent": "${state.otherMatches}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "empty": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-message"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Elements you can drop onto the page live here: headings, text, images, layout containers and more."
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-accordion",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "list"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "$prototype": "Array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/state/categories"
              },
              "key": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/name"
              },
              "map": {
                "tagName": "jx-accordion-item",
                "$props": {
                  "label": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                  },
                  "open": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/open"
                  }
                },
                "attributes": {
                  "data-section": "${$map.item.key}"
                },
                "ontoggle": {
                  "$prototype": "Function",
                  "body": [
                    {
                      "operator": "call",
                      "target": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/setSectionOpen"
                      },
                      "value": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                        },
                        {
                          "$ref": "event#/detail"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "$prototype": "Array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/elements"
                    },
                    "key": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/tag"
                    },
                    "map": {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "class": "element-card",
                        "data-block-tag": "${$map.item.tag}",
                        "title": "${$map.item.description}"
                      },
                      "onclick": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/insertElement"
                            },
                            "value": [
                              {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/tag"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "element-card-preview"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "class": "element-card-label"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "element-name"
                              },
                              "textContent": "${$map.item.name}"
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "element-tag"
                              },
                              "textContent": "<${$map.item.tag}>"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-tab-panel",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "panel",
        "id": "insert-panel-components",
        "data-tab": "components"
      },
      "$props": {
        "active": {
          "$ref": "#/state/componentsShowing"
        },
        "labelledby": "insert-tab-components"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "empty-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/componentsEmpty"
          },
          "cases": {
            "filtered": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-message"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Nothing here matches “${state.filter}”."
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-actions"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "jx-button",
                      "$props": {
                        "size": "sm"
                      },
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "clear-filter"
                      },
                      "onclick": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/clearFilter"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "textContent": "Clear the filter"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "other-tab-slot",
                        "role": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "display": "contents"
                      },
                      "$switch": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/hasOtherMatches"
                      },
                      "cases": {
                        "true": {
                          "tagName": "jx-button",
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm"
                          },
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "show-other-tab"
                          },
                          "onclick": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/showOtherTab"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "textContent": "${state.otherMatches}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "empty": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-message"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Components you make live here. Right-click a block and choose Convert to Component, or create one with Add new."
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "components-section",
            "part": "components-section"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "$prototype": "Array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/state/components"
              },
              "key": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/tagName"
              },
              "map": {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "class": "element-card",
                  "data-component-tag": "${$map.item.tagName}",
                  "title": "${$map.item.title}"
                },
                "onclick": {
                  "$prototype": "Function",
                  "body": [
                    {
                      "operator": "call",
                      "target": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/insertComponent"
                      },
                      "value": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/tagName"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "class": "element-card-preview"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "component-tag"
                        },
                        "textContent": "<${$map.item.tagName}>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "class": "element-card-label"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "element-name"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.tagName}"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
